wget url

wget url1 url2 .....


Specify different logfile path

wget url -O filename -o log

To specify the number of tries , use the -t flag 

wget -t 5 url

wget -t 0 url --> for infinite tries

Speed limit
-----------

wget --limit-race 20k url

Maximum quota
-------------

wget -Q 100m url -O filename -o log 

Resume download
---------------

wget -c url

Mirroring
---------

wget --mirror --convert-links url

Auth
----

wget --user username --password pass URL


